                                        "sense_id": "8f97bf45-dcc3-3106-84e8-f20b8ecbda32",
                                        "entry_id": "e742b055-8b84-3dcd-a992-2c78da297150",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A plant of the genus Trifolium with leaves usually divided into three (rarely four) leaflets and with white or red flowers."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "01ec30a1-680d-45c0-9bbb-0340576a4a87",
                                                "sense_id": "8f97bf45-dcc3-3106-84e8-f20b8ecbda32",
                                                "text": "He Raine upon her [the Earth's] boſom poures; / His ſvvelling clouds abound vvith ſhoures: / […] / The Deſert with ſvveet claver fills; / And richly ſhades the joyfull Hills."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
